            "coord_origin": "CoordOrigin.BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            337
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "Optional redemption is permitted after October 20, 2028, at the direction of the subordinated noteholders. The Collateral Manager receives a Base Management Fee of 0.15% per annum and a Subordinated Management Fee of 0.35% per annum. An incentive fee of 20% is applicable once a 12% IRR is achieved for the subordinated interest holders."
